All done. Here's a summary of the changes:

**`go/ast/inspector/inspector.go`** — added:
```go
// Len returns the number of AST nodes the inspector holds,
// the same count [ast.Inspect] visits over the files given to [New].
func (in *Inspector) Len() int {
	return len(in.events) / 2
}
```

Each node produces one push event and one pop event in the `events` slice, so dividing by 2 gives the node count.

**`go/ast/inspector/inspector_test.go`** — added `TestLen` which compares `inspect.Len()` against the count from `ast.Inspect` over the same files (using the `net` package).

All tests pass (`go test -count=1 ./go/ast/inspector/`).

